@startuml
title Statechart diagram of E-Ticketing System

[*] --> Unregistered : «M» Start/

state Unregistered
state Registered
state LoggedIn
state TicketBooking
state AccountManagement
state LoggedOut

Unregistered : entry / User not logged in/
Unregistered : do / Create new account/
Unregistered : exit / Registration process/

Unregistered --> Registered : «M» registration success/
Unregistered --> Unregistered : «M» registration failed/

Registered : entry / New user registered/
Registered : do / Validate registration details/
Registered : exit / Login enabled/

Registered --> LoggedIn : «M» login success/
Registered --> Registered : «M» login failed/

LoggedIn : entry / User logged in/
LoggedIn : do / Access dashboard/
LoggedIn : exit / Ready for actions/

LoggedIn --> TicketBooking : «M» Book ticket/
LoggedIn --> AccountManagement : «M» Manage account/
LoggedIn --> LoggedOut : «M» Logout/

TicketBooking : entry / Booking process started/
TicketBooking : do / Confirm booking details/
TicketBooking : exit / Payment processing/

TicketBooking --> LoggedIn : «M» payment confirmed/
TicketBooking --> TicketBooking : «M» cancel booking/

AccountManagement : entry / Account management started/
AccountManagement : do / Edit or delete account details/
AccountManagement : exit / Return to dashboard/

AccountManagement --> LoggedIn : «M» changes saved/
AccountManagement --> AccountManagement : «M» changes failed/

LoggedIn --> [*] : «M» logout action/

@enduml
